{"uploader": "智能魔术师", "uploader_id": "478306245", "like_count": 76, "tags": ["程序", "单片机", "无刷驱动", "电机", "FOC", "无刷电机", "编程开发"], "thumbnail": "http://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/aad8de86da203951db4c54bd40ad576f75220f27.jpg", "description": "STM32G431 无刷电机 霍尔传感器 FOC 项目程序讲解。\n本视频主要讲解 ADC、TIM1 和 TIM3 的配置。\nTIM1 用于输出三相互补 PWM，驱动三相逆变桥。\nTIM1_CH4 用于触发 ADC 注入采样，实现 PWM 同步电流采样。\nADC1/ADC2 用于采集相电流，给 FOC 电流环提供反馈。\nADC 规则组配合 DMA，用于采集母线电压和温度等运行状态。\nTIM3 配置为 Hall Sensor 模式，用于检测 Hall 跳变、获取转子位置并计算转速。\n内容主要偏向 CubeMX 配置和程序逻辑，用于记录无刷电机 FOC 项目的调试过程。", "timestamp": 1784106000, "view_count": 2114, "comment_count": 20, "id": "BV1YiTb6dEED", "_old_archive_ids": ["bilibili 116856446781438_part1"], "title": "开源-STM32G431-FOC-无刷电机-1程序讲解-初始化", "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YiTb6dEED/"}, "formats": [{"url": "https://upos-sz-mirrorcos.bilivideo.com/upgcxcode/93/64/39625756493/39625756493-1-30216.m4s?e=ig8euxZM2rNcNbdlhoNvNC8BqJIzNbfqXBvEqxTEto8BTrNvN0GvT90W5JZMkX_YN0MvXg8gNEV4NC8xNEV4N03eN0B5tZlqNxTEto8BTrNvNeZVuJ10Kj_g2UB02J0mN0B5tZlqNCNEto8BTrNvNC7MTX502C8f2jmMQJ6mqF2fka1mqx6gqj0eN0B599M=&nbs=1&oi=664447097&og=cos&uipk=5&deadline=1789987634&gen=playurlv3&os=cosbv&platform=pc&trid=e2d6c75fa8794b75bb734f80faab4a7u&mid=3461562375342187&upsig=87d6bb2512eb767cc4019a9944c2ccad&uparams=e,nbs,oi,og,uipk,deadline,gen,os,platform,trid,mid&bvc=vod&nettype=0&bw=65712&lrs=-1&buvid=E8010D3A-ED79-58C9-1608-9BD0630C03B175654infoc&build=0&dl=0&f=u_0_0&qn_dyeid=d3ed41ee6992aa5000a27c986ab0ef12&agrr=1&orderid=0,3", "ext": "m4a", "acodec": "mp4a.40.2", "vcodec": "none", "tbr": 65.684, "format_id": "30216", "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 65.684, "resolution": "audio only", "filesize_approx": 8015090, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "e